Description: reusable Yu OS system agent for Debian and Ubuntu
 Installs the complete headless Yu OS agent stack: `yu`, `yuosd`,
 `yuos-agentd`, `yuos-extension-host`, the Claw-owned terminal UI, browser and
 semantic runtimes, capability and approval enforcement, audit/session
 persistence, skills and SDK/runtime libraries. Headless Apps and their common
 libraries are separately owned packages recommended through yuos-apps-agent.
 .
 The package also installs and enables the privileged `yuosd` system
 service. Agent work itself runs in unprivileged, per-task
 `yuos-agentd` and task-owned `yuos-extension-host` processes that `yuosd`
 supervises. Browser and user indexing services are installed but remain
 opt-in or condition-gated.
 OS desktop packages use its Root PAM display activation and supervised GUI
 transport helpers; their presence does not grant any App a GUI resource.
 It does not alter the host's home layout, boot identity, desktop
 environment, PAM policy, or firmware policy. Helium is optional on
 agent-only installs and required by the Browser App.
